WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.700
Looking to enhance your ad creatives with AI?

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:08.293
Amazon Ads offers a range of AI-powered tools designed to help you produce high-quality visuals

00:00:08.293 --> 00:00:09.280
quickly and easily.

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:13.884
Whether you're just getting started or refining your creative strategy, understanding how to guide

00:00:13.884 --> 00:00:15.200
these tools is key.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:21.162
In this video, we'll cover five key tips to help you improve your prompts and create high-quality

00:00:21.162 --> 00:00:23.480
visuals with Amazon Ads' AI creative solutions.

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:28.340
By the end, you'll know how to guide our AI-powered tools to more effectively generate quality,

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:31.760
on-brand creative that supports your advertising goals.

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:34.220
First, be clear and specific with your prompts.

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:40.671
Instead of a broad idea, use detailed and rich language that captures your desired subject, style,

00:00:40.671 --> 00:00:41.880
mood, and colors.

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:48.690
Instead of using a generic prompt like "a dog," use a golden retriever puppy, playing in a sunny

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.960
park, captured in soft morning light.

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:53.104
Second, include context and brand elements.

00:00:53.104 --> 00:00:59.179
Add any brand cues or campaign themes to guide the AI's output, example prompt, an urban coffee

00:00:59.179 --> 00:01:04.540
shop in the early morning, featuring my brand's coffee cups next to an espresso machine.

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:10.060
Third, leverage references and adjust parameters.

00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:15.878
Amazon's tools let you upload reference creative or choose from built-in themes or styles, allowing

00:01:15.878 --> 00:01:18.060
greater control over the creative output.

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:24.486
Upload reference images to maintain consistent color palettes or subject positioning, ensuring visual

00:01:24.486 --> 00:01:24.980
harmony.

00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:27.460
Fourth, don't be afraid to experiment.

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:29.060
AI is a creative partner.

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:33.660
Try out different prompt variations, themes, and apply edits to see what resonates.

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:39.477
Keep a log of the prompts and cues that produce the best outputs for your product and brand, making

00:01:39.477 --> 00:01:41.620
it easier to replicate success over time.

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:44.965
Finally, review and save or submit your newly generated creative.

00:01:44.965 --> 00:01:48.980
Carefully evaluate the outputs generated to make sure they meet your standards.

00:01:48.980 --> 00:01:54.599
Save to your Amazon Ads Creative Asset Library for later use on your sponsored ad campaigns and

00:01:54.599 --> 00:01:55.260
brand store.

00:01:55.260 --> 00:02:01.009
By following these five best practices, you'll be on your way to creating stunning, on-brand visuals

00:02:01.009 --> 00:02:02.700
with Amazon's AI creative tools.
